# Virtue Studio — line-ending policy
#
# Normalize to LF in both the repository and the working tree, regardless of
# any developer's `core.autocrlf` setting. Biome enforces `lineEnding: "lf"`
# (see biome.json), so CRLF checkouts make `pnpm lint` fail on every file git
# converted; this file makes the checkout match the formatter everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binaries — never apply line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.bmp binary
*.tiff binary
*.pdf binary
